# xc2/tests/rexface.nxs - cut straight to the prologue's Rex/dragon scene and capture it frame by frame.
#
# Built from the first sweep (testout_deck): the deck conversation with Rex lands at frames ~6300-7100 at 30 game steps per
# second. Run with the same [test] keys as deck.nxs; add NXRT_NVN_TRACE_FRAME=6600 to trace that exact frame (deterministic
# mode makes the frame number reproducible, which is the whole point).

@rate 30
@timeout 20000          # every later wait may take this many frames (default 3600 is under the opening's length)
@log rexface.nxs: boot + title presses
600
press A
60
press A
60
press A
@sleep 3000

@frame 5600
@shot f5600
@frame 5800
@shot f5800
@frame 6000
@shot f6000
@frame 6100
@shot f6100
@frame 6200
@shot f6200
@frame 6300
@shot f6300
@frame 6400
@shot f6400
@frame 6500
@shot f6500
@frame 6600
@shot f6600
@frame 6700
@shot f6700
@frame 6800
@shot f6800
@frame 6900
@shot f6900
@frame 7000
@shot f7000
@frame 7100
@shot f7100

@pass
